00:24:38.920 --> 00:24:42.000
Viewership is off the charts
for eSports versus NFL.

00:24:42.000 --> 00:24:45.040
It's more people worldwide watch them.

00:24:45.040 --> 00:24:48.240
That ratio though of people
who've attended an event,

00:24:48.240 --> 00:24:52.460
is 0.0001% of people who've seen it online

00:24:52.460 --> 00:24:55.260
versus maybe 40% of people
who watch the NFL maybe

00:24:56.606 --> 00:24:57.610
have been to a game.

00:24:57.610 --> 00:24:59.245
That's probably high but it's where--

00:24:59.245 --> 00:25:01.184
- It's absolutely the
point given the nature

00:25:01.184 --> 00:25:02.370
