00:25:23.649 --> 00:25:24.990
those early things, Madison Square Gardens

00:25:24.990 --> 00:25:27.289
fastest sellout event, right?

00:25:27.289 --> 00:25:28.450
It's there.

00:25:28.450 --> 00:25:30.950
It's there and obviously
one thing that Americans do

00:25:31.810 --> 00:25:32.733
