00:25:34.699 --> 00:25:36.970
So it just needs more broad interest.

00:25:36.970 --> 00:25:40.226
The education of the parents
is going to be enormous.

00:25:40.226 --> 00:25:43.102
As we continue to see
videos like we just saw,

00:25:43.102 --> 00:25:45.664
