00:25:51.110 --> 00:25:51.980
That will happen.

00:25:51.980 --> 00:25:54.960
And the leagues themselves
have to get their act together.

00:25:54.960 --> 00:25:57.070
We haven't had organized leagues.

00:25:57.070 --> 00:25:59.750
We've had one-off events,
we've had micro events

00:26:01.887 --> 00:26:02.970
but this again, UFC's
