00:26:06.520 --> 00:26:08.928
proper media attention,
proper story building,

00:26:08.928 --> 00:26:12.410
a couple of superstars and away you go.

00:26:12.410 --> 00:26:16.680
The fact that we have Bugga and
Ninja already, this early on

00:26:16.680 --> 00:26:18.733
