though it already happened.

00:27:30.850 --> 00:27:32.650
Khalid on Snap.

00:27:32.650 --> 00:27:35.100
I don't know what's gonna
happen for this league,

00:27:36.769 --> 00:27:38.246
I just know it's gonna happen.

00:27:38.246 --> 00:27:39.660
I think all of us here
at some level know Bugga

00:27:39.660 --> 00:27:41.870
