00:27:50.038 --> 00:27:52.683
Good Morning America and
then the process will start.

00:27:54.380 --> 00:27:55.303
That's America.

00:27:56.212 --> 00:27:57.489
- [Tyler] Thank you.

00:27:57.489 --> 00:27:59.509
