00:28:58.734 --> 00:29:01.930
Media agencies love their
black boxes of programmatic

00:29:01.930 --> 00:29:03.835
because they're making tons of,

00:29:03.835 --> 00:29:05.437
this is the business I'm
actually in full time.

00:29:05.437 --> 00:29:07.170
It's a very easy answer.

00:29:07.170 --> 00:29:09.060
It's the same thing I have on social.

00:29:09.060 --> 00:29:11.760
It's why so many brands are
declining in market share.

00:29:13.715 --> 00:29:15.814
The vested interest of
the six holding companies

00:29:15.814 --> 00:29:17.120
media departments and their clients,

00:29:17.120 --> 00:29:19.020
are completely in opposite directions.

00:29:20.414 --> 00:29:22.080
90% of the media spent
in America is being spent

00:29:22.080 --> 00:29:25.480
