its own margin every 90 days.

00:29:28.750 --> 00:29:31.400
How in the world can that
be a good service provider?

00:29:33.057 --> 00:29:34.883
So what's gonna happen?

00:29:35.815 --> 00:29:37.580
One of two things: one,
we will continue to see

00:29:38.437 --> 00:29:40.354
