that traditional media model?

00:29:57.570 --> 00:29:58.900
- That's right.

00:29:58.900 --> 00:30:00.830
Or you scare your current age.

00:30:00.830 --> 00:30:03.310
What real life is you have enough juice

00:30:04.454 --> 00:30:06.991
